    'Hi {{FirstName}},\n\nI came across the {{Role}} opening at {{Company}} ({{JobURL}}) and wanted to reach out directly. {{ApplyPhrase}}, and I think my background is a strong fit.\n\nI\'ve attached my resume. Would you be open to a short chat, or could you point me to the recruiter handling this role?\n\nThanks,\n{{SenderName}}',
    'Y', 'First mail of a job thread. Review before leaving DRY_RUN.'],
